---
const facts = [
  ['School', 'the school Kingswood, Class of 2027'],
  ['Where', 'Detroit area, Michigan'],
  ['Languages', 'English, Mandarin, Swift, TypeScript, Python'],
  ['Next', 'Business with a CS minor, building the whole way through'],
];
---
<section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="head up">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2 id="about-title">Robotics came first</h2>
      <p class="lead about-p">VEX Worlds as a freshman, then founding the school’s FRC team, then software
        when the season ended and the itch didn’t. Most of what I know came from documentation
        and from shipping things that broke. Next year is business with a CS minor, and I’ll
        keep building the whole way through.</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="facts up">
      {facts.map(([k, v]) => (<div><dt>{k}</dt><dd>{v}</dd></div>))}
      <div><dt>Local time</dt><dd><time class="num" data-clock-long>—</time></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { padding-top: var(--sec); }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px 64px; align-items: start; }
  .about-p { max-width: 44ch; }
  .facts { margin: 0; display: grid; padding-top: 8px; }
  .facts div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 110px 1fr; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: var(--t-ui); }
  .facts div:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .facts dt { font-size: var(--t-tiny); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-3); padding-top: 4px; }
  .facts dd { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 34px; } }
</style>
